        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana HP70, Hinge Pin Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis universal fit door stop is mounted on a door hinge pin instead of on the floor or baseboard. Easily adjustable, simple to use, out of the way and out of sight. It has a universal fit for use with most common sized door hinges (3.5\" x 3.5\", 4\" x 4\" and 4.5\" x 4.5\" door hinges). It works with all hinges that have a hinge pin of 5/16\" diameter or less. The door opening adjustment range is approximately from 90 degrees to 140 degrees. Note that the thickness of the jamb moulding and the distance of the hinge pin from the door face will affect the adjustment range for each application. Very popular and available in 12 great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"316\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-HP70-specifications.gif?v=1704354513\" width=\"316\" height=\"224\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Universal Hinge Pin Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana HP70 Hinge Pin Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin Diameter with Reducer Bushing: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Opening Range: 90 - 140 Degrees, Approximate</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumpers: 9/16\" Diameter, Gray Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Install</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HP70.pdf?v=1704262156\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana HP70 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Universal Hinge Pin Door Stop",
                "description": "Universal Hinge Pin Door Stop Deltana HP70  - This universal fit door stop is mounted on a door hinge pin instead of on the floor or baseboard. Easily adjustable, simple to use, out of the way and out of sight. It has a universal fit for use with most common sized door hinges (3.5 inch x 3.5 inch, 4 inch x 4 inch and 4.5 inch x 4.5 inch door hinges). It works with all hinges that have a hinge pin of 5/16 inch diameter or less. The door opening adjustment range is approximately from 90 degrees to 140 degrees. Note that the thickness of the jamb moulding and the distance of the hinge pin from the door face will affect the adjustment range for each application. Very popular and available in 12 great finishes.",
